    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.poster.avif?t=1754937918\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.webm?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.mp4?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play from the top-down inspired camera, experience the linear story  and  puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Mysterious Levels:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure through uniquely designed levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <i>challenging puzzles</i> to progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt Monsters:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <i>dangerous monsters</i> and defeat them with <strong><i>fast paced</i></strong> combat mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Story:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of the unfolding story and immerse yourself in the adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover New Mechanics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore innovative gameplay mechanics and become stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt with Special Skill:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun\u2019s special skill to eliminate enemies with limited bullets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress with Your Katana:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your katana to fight enemies and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Be a raccoon master.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.poster.avif?t=1754937918\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.webm?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.mp4?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.poster.avif?t=1754937918\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.webm?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/11fbb14d8cf6d52666e1bee5bcee26b2.mp4?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play from the top-down inspired camera, experience the linear story  and  puzzle elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Mysterious Levels:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure through uniquely designed levels.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve Puzzles:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <i>challenging puzzles</i> to progress.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt Monsters:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle <i>dangerous monsters</i> and defeat them with <strong><i>fast paced</i></strong> combat mechanics.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Our Story:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a part of the unfolding story and immerse yourself in the adventure.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover New Mechanics:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore innovative gameplay mechanics and become stronger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt with Special Skill:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your gun\u2019s special skill to eliminate enemies with limited bullets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress with Your Katana:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your katana to fight enemies and continue your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <i>Be a raccoon master.</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.poster.avif?t=1754937918\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.webm?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377570/extras/48122a8ea99d2efc8a5e8f766460b6d3.mp4?t=1754937918\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
